#: ../../index.rst:4 e004092927284c0bad4a33bf67d8a106
msgid ""
"``async-hyperliquid`` is an asynchronous, typed Python client for "
"Hyperliquid's HTTP Info and Exchange APIs. It separates credential-free "
"reads from signed actions and makes network, endpoint, account, and vault"
" routing explicit."
msgstr ""
"``async-hyperliquid`` 是用于 Hyperliquid HTTP Info 和 Exchange API 的异步、带类型的 Python 客户端。"
"它将无需凭据的读取与已签名操作分离，并明确网络、端点、账户和 vault 的路由。"

#: ../../index.rst:8 82e3ffaef8f6458eaaf3c6c991660d66
msgid ""
"Start with the read-only quickstart. Before enabling signed actions, read"
" the account-routing, endpoint-trust, and reconciliation guidance."
msgstr "请从只读快速入门开始。在启用已签名操作前，请阅读账户路由、端点信任与对账指南。"
